WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:42.292 --> 00:00:45.963
"Minister Kim's Dream Life"

2
00:00:47.214 --> 00:00:49.716
Master, are you okay?

3
00:00:50.217 --> 00:00:52.177
Are you still alive?

4
00:00:55.138 --> 00:00:57.516
master

5
00:00:58.684 --> 00:01:00.561
I asked you if anything happened?

6
00:01:00.644 --> 00:01:03.355
Master? Hello!

7
00:01:04.398 --> 00:01:06.066
Well I'm fine

8
00:01:06.149 --> 00:01:07.859
Oh my god

9
00:01:07.943 --> 00:01:09.236
Oops

10
00:01:09.319 --> 00:01:12.906
Damn, the car was a total wreck.

11
00:01:13.699 --> 00:01:15.659
Oops, this is really going crazy

12
00:01:16.868 --> 00:01:19.663
Where is my mobile phone?

13
00:01:22.291 --> 00:01:23.458
(He Zhen)

14
00:01:23.542 --> 00:01:26.712
Someone named Ha Zhen is calling you.

15
00:01:28.171 --> 00:01:29.298
give me

16
00:01:29.381 --> 00:01:30.591
Oops, hello?

17
00:01:30.674 --> 00:01:32.050
Hello hubby

18
00:01:32.134 --> 00:01:34.595
There was an accident here

19
00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:36.346
Who are you?

20
00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:39.308
He was helping me drive just now

21
00:01:39.391 --> 00:01:42.394
Your husband is my chauffeur

22
00:01:46.898 --> 00:01:48.483
Wife, it’s me

23
00:01:48.567 --> 00:01:49.443
Husband

24
00:01:51.945 --> 00:01:53.989
(Emergency Room)

25
00:02:52.798 --> 00:02:53.924
Won't you go up?

26
00:02:54.007 --> 00:02:55.425
Go up

27
00:02:55.509 --> 00:02:57.928
- Then why don't you get off the car?
- I'll be up right away

28
00:02:59.388 --> 00:03:00.555
Hurry up

29
00:03:22.244 --> 00:03:23.453
Why haven't you come back yet?

30
00:03:26.456 --> 00:03:28.166
What are you doing standing there? Go to sleep

31
00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:29.418
Dad?

32
00:03:29.501 --> 00:03:30.877
What's wrong?

33
00:03:31.628 --> 00:03:33.463
Why did you go to be a contemporary driver?

34
00:03:34.631 --> 00:03:36.842
Just do whatever you want. What's wrong? Any questions?

35
00:03:37.467 --> 00:03:38.802
I like driving

36
00:03:41.012 --> 00:03:42.389
Is it because of me?

37
00:03:43.056 --> 00:03:45.976
Stop talking nonsense

38
00:03:46.059 --> 00:03:48.103
Oops son

39
00:03:48.186 --> 00:03:49.896
You have grown so big

40
00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:52.315
When did you grow so tall?

41
00:03:53.024 --> 00:03:54.401
Your mother is back

42
00:03:54.943 --> 00:03:57.404
I'm so sorry that so many things happened so early in the morning.

43
00:03:57.487 --> 00:03:59.197
You must not have had much sleep at all, right?

44
00:04:00.657 --> 00:04:02.075
go to sleep

45
00:04:02.784 --> 00:04:04.369
Suqian, go back to your room

46
00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:15.964
Wife, let’s go get some sleep

47
00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:22.596
Let's go

48
00:04:23.555 --> 00:04:24.473
Where to go?

49
00:04:24.556 --> 00:04:25.849
Go to psychiatry

50
00:04:28.059 --> 00:04:28.935
Oops

51
00:04:29.019 --> 00:04:32.939
You heard what the emergency doctor said.
Let's go there and listen to what they have to say.

52
00:04:33.023 --> 00:04:35.567
The inspection results are all normal

53
00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:36.985
Doctors are just talking nonsense...

54
00:04:37.068 --> 00:04:40.155
You still don't trust the doctor? Okay, I understand.

55
00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:42.532
Suqian, close the door

56
00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:48.246
Then do you listen to me?

57
00:04:51.792 --> 00:04:54.753
There are too many things I can't figure out now

58
00:04:55.504 --> 00:04:58.131
I don't want to keep guessing all day long at home

59
00:04:58.215 --> 00:04:59.132
this feels so bad

60
00:05:00.258 --> 00:05:03.804
So don't listen to the doctor, listen to me

61
00:05:05.430 --> 00:05:06.389
Go to a psychiatrist

62
00:05:07.766 --> 00:05:09.017
- I'm not going
- go

63
00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:11.853
If I say I'm fine, I'll be fine

64
00:05:20.070 --> 00:05:22.155
(Go straight for 8 kilometers)

65
00:05:25.867 --> 00:05:26.743
Hello?

66
00:05:31.498 --> 00:05:33.959
Bastard, don't you have any idea?

67
00:05:34.709 --> 00:05:36.002
Do you really think you are a big shot?

68
00:05:36.086 --> 00:05:37.712
Megalomaniac

69
00:05:39.631 --> 00:05:40.632
What to look at?

70
00:05:41.132 --> 00:05:42.259
Look ahead

71
00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:44.427
sorry

72
00:05:45.637 --> 00:05:46.763
Shut up, asshole!

73
00:05:48.223 --> 00:05:51.685
Don't pretend to be working

74
00:05:51.768 --> 00:05:54.145
Get down to business. Who do you think you are?

75
00:05:55.230 --> 00:05:57.774
Master, I told you to look at the front

76
00:05:57.858 --> 00:05:59.442
Re-routing in progress

77
00:05:59.526 --> 00:06:00.652
Hang up, bastard!

78
00:06:02.153 --> 00:06:05.198
Are you sure you want to go here? This place...

79
00:06:05.782 --> 00:06:08.118
This is the store I bought from

80
00:06:08.201 --> 00:06:10.495
Sir, why are we going here?

81
00:06:14.249 --> 00:06:17.168
In the end, you carried us on our backs for the rest of our lives.

82
00:06:17.669 --> 00:06:19.254
A debt that I can't even repay.

83
00:06:24.676 --> 00:06:26.428
You must have bought life insurance, right?

84
00:06:28.179 --> 00:06:29.556
That's worse than

85
00:06:29.639 --> 00:06:31.641
Wouldn't it be better just like this?

86
00:06:31.725 --> 00:06:32.851
What do you think?

87
00:06:48.867 --> 00:06:50.493
Dad, it’s time to have breakfast

88
00:06:52.621 --> 00:06:53.496
Dad?

89
00:06:54.748 --> 00:06:55.707
Dad!

90
00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:59.336
Mom! Dad, he...

91
00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:00.837
Dad, are you okay?

92
00:07:00.921 --> 00:07:03.214
- I can't breathe.
- What's wrong?

93
00:07:03.298 --> 00:07:04.549
- Husband
- I gasp...

94
00:07:05.091 --> 00:07:06.843
What's going on?

95
00:07:06.927 --> 00:07:08.053
- Husband
- Call an ambulance via mobile phone

96
00:07:08.136 --> 00:07:09.471
- I can't breathe.
- Are you out of breath?

97
00:07:09.554 --> 00:07:11.389
I think I need to go to the hospital

98
00:07:11.473 --> 00:07:13.683
- Good Soo-gyeom!
- Where is my mobile phone?

99
00:07:13.767 --> 00:07:14.893
- Go to the hospital now
- OK

100
00:07:14.976 --> 00:07:15.894
- No
- Help him up

101
00:07:15.977 --> 00:07:16.937
Let's send him there

102
00:07:18.021 --> 00:07:18.939
Get up

103
00:07:19.022 --> 00:07:20.899
Oh my god, look at all this sweat.

104
00:07:20.982 --> 00:07:22.025
- Mom, wait a minute.
- OK

105
00:07:27.781 --> 00:07:29.866
hey wife

106
00:07:32.744 --> 00:07:34.371
I don't feel the need to go

107
00:07:36.623 --> 00:07:37.499
What?

108
00:07:37.582 --> 00:07:39.501
I'm feeling better now. Let's go back.

109
00:07:40.126 --> 00:07:44.005
You have to go to work. It's time for you to go to class, right?

110
00:07:44.798 --> 00:07:45.674
What?

111
00:07:45.757 --> 00:07:47.550
I'm fine. Let's go up. Hurry.

112
00:07:50.136 --> 00:07:53.264
Why are you like this? I told you I'm fine

113
00:07:53.807 --> 00:07:55.725
Nothing happens to me

114
00:07:59.187 --> 00:08:00.105
Nothing happened?

115
00:08:00.188 --> 00:08:04.609
Yes, I just need to have a good sleep
Just relieve the pressure and you'll be fine

116
00:08:04.693 --> 00:08:06.319
let's go up

117
00:08:06.403 --> 00:08:08.863
Wake up, Kim Nak-soo!

118
00:08:09.406 --> 00:08:10.699
Do you think this is normal?

119
00:08:10.782 --> 00:08:12.784
Is this something a sane person would do?

120
00:08:13.410 --> 00:08:16.788
Are you crazy?
Don't you think about your family at all?

121
00:08:17.414 --> 00:08:20.667
You almost died!

122
00:08:21.543 --> 00:08:23.586
you have to see a psychiatrist

123
00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:27.424
A sane person would never do this

124
00:08:27.507 --> 00:08:28.550
Let's go

125
00:08:29.259 --> 00:08:30.593
Hurry up

126
00:08:31.136 --> 00:08:32.887
OK I'll go

127
00:08:33.430 --> 00:08:34.472
- OK
- Get on the bus

128
00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:38.184
No, you don't have to go. Just go with your mother.

129
00:08:38.977 --> 00:08:40.145
Go to class

130
00:08:50.447 --> 00:08:52.991
Why are there so many people?

131
00:08:54.325 --> 00:08:56.619
{\an8}(The parking space is full, please wait in line)

132
00:09:08.757 --> 00:09:10.008
Come on come on

133
00:09:15.180 --> 00:09:16.848
(Yijiang General Hospital)

134
00:09:45.126 --> 00:09:46.252
Let's get back to the car

135
00:09:46.336 --> 00:09:47.754
What's wrong?

136
00:09:50.632 --> 00:09:54.302
Look how serious you have become

137
00:09:54.385 --> 00:09:55.762
How are you holding on during this time...

138
00:09:55.845 --> 00:09:57.722
Go somewhere else. I'm fine.

139
00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:02.852
Don't go to a general hospital. Go to a clinic. There are fewer people.

140
00:10:02.936 --> 00:10:06.022
Why is the clinic closed again today?

141
00:10:06.106 --> 00:10:07.482
Really

142
00:10:08.441 --> 00:10:09.651
Come to the second floor when you have time

143
00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:11.820
let's talk

144
00:10:11.903 --> 00:10:13.488
Oops

145
00:10:13.571 --> 00:10:15.198
Wait, in that case...

146
00:10:19.077 --> 00:10:20.912
(Wangzhen Shopping Center)

147
00:10:21.913 --> 00:10:22.914
(Start navigation)

148
00:10:22.997 --> 00:10:24.082
let's go here

149
00:10:24.833 --> 00:10:26.126
{\an8}Do you know this place?

150
00:10:26.209 --> 00:10:27.710
{\an8}Episode 10: Patient No. 102

151
00:10:27.794 --> 00:10:29.087
{\an8}Let's go first.

152
00:10:29.629 --> 00:10:32.632
(Huiyin Psychiatric Clinic)

153
00:10:36.928 --> 00:10:39.889
Sorry, when will the doctor come?

154
00:10:39.973 --> 00:10:43.059
I'm not sure. No one has made an appointment today.

155
00:10:43.143 --> 00:10:45.145
He is probably enjoying his lunch slowly.

156
00:10:46.229 --> 00:10:48.356
Please fill out the consultation form first

157
00:10:50.692 --> 00:10:52.152
Something doesn't seem right about this place.

158
00:10:52.944 --> 00:10:54.779
Just watch it here

159
00:10:55.947 --> 00:10:57.198
(panic disorder symptom list)

160
00:10:57.282 --> 00:10:58.575
(...Experienced uneasiness or fear? No)

161
00:10:58.658 --> 00:11:00.076
(The attack reaches its peak a few minutes after it begins)

162
00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:01.411
Well this...

163
00:11:01.494 --> 00:11:02.620
(no)

164
00:11:04.831 --> 00:11:07.125
(...change behavior to avoid seizures No)

165
00:11:08.376 --> 00:11:09.627
answer honestly

166
00:11:09.711 --> 00:11:10.837
I'm very honest

167
00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:13.298
No, not this either

168
00:11:13.381 --> 00:11:14.924
I'm back

169
00:11:15.008 --> 00:11:17.677
Have you gone to have a big meal? What took you so long?

170
00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:19.220
Shangyang snack bar closed down

171
00:11:19.304 --> 00:11:20.680
Really?

172
00:11:20.763 --> 00:11:22.891
So I ran all the way...

173
00:11:25.643 --> 00:11:26.686
Huh?

174
00:11:27.896 --> 00:11:29.814
You're here. It's on the first floor...

175
00:11:29.898 --> 00:11:31.024
Okay let's go in

176
00:11:31.524 --> 00:11:32.859
Doctor, please show me

177
00:11:32.942 --> 00:11:34.235
Sir, bring the consultation form

178
00:11:34.319 --> 00:11:35.653
please give it to me

179
00:11:35.737 --> 00:11:36.613
(treatment room)

180
00:11:38.114 --> 00:11:40.283
- Questionnaire
- OK

181
00:11:40.366 --> 00:11:41.743
Go in

182
00:11:41.826 --> 00:11:43.244
(Diagnosis and treatment areas: anxiety and panic disorder)

183
00:11:49.083 --> 00:11:50.752
Would you like a cup of tea?

184
00:11:51.669 --> 00:11:52.754
No thanks

185
00:11:52.837 --> 00:11:54.964
Okay, please sit down for a while.

186
00:12:03.431 --> 00:12:05.642
I'll leave in ten minutes

187
00:12:08.519 --> 00:12:10.021
So Madam doesn’t know yet

188
00:12:11.147 --> 00:12:12.023
What do you know?

189
00:12:12.106 --> 00:12:14.150
What happened when you bought the shop on the first floor?

190
00:12:17.695 --> 00:12:19.280
I know what to do

191
00:12:19.364 --> 00:12:21.658
You have to confess to her quickly and let's discuss countermeasures together.

192
00:12:21.741 --> 00:12:23.284
then take medicine

193
00:12:24.077 --> 00:12:24.953
What medicine?

194
00:12:25.036 --> 00:12:26.412
Of course it's medicine for panic disorder.

195
00:12:27.163 --> 00:12:29.958
I'll prescribe two kinds for you. One is anti-anxiety medicine.

196
00:12:30.041 --> 00:12:32.627
Take if you have a panic attack or have trouble breathing

197
00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:35.171
-Another one is an antidepressant...
- Hello

198
00:12:36.673 --> 00:12:38.549
You didn't even look at the consultation form

199
00:12:38.633 --> 00:12:41.761
They didn't check me either.
How can you say I have panic disorder?

200
00:12:41.844 --> 00:12:42.720
What a liar

201
00:12:42.804 --> 00:12:45.056
I have confirmed your symptoms with my own eyes

202
00:12:45.139 --> 00:12:46.391
When?

203
00:12:48.434 --> 00:12:49.644
good

204
00:12:51.688 --> 00:12:52.939
What? What does it mean?

205
00:12:53.022 --> 00:12:55.400
Please come and take a look

206
00:12:55.984 --> 00:12:57.110
What's wrong?

207
00:12:59.404 --> 00:13:00.321
Optimistic

208
00:13:00.405 --> 00:13:02.365
You walked over there that day

209
00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:07.704
Then I felt it was getting harder and harder to breathe

210
00:13:08.997 --> 00:13:11.708
You covered your chest and collapsed to the ground in front of this building.

211
00:13:11.791 --> 00:13:13.209
Mr. Kim Nak-soo

212
00:13:16.587 --> 00:13:18.423
I helped you that day

213
00:13:19.215 --> 00:13:21.050
- Are you okay?
- Sorry

214
00:13:21.134 --> 00:13:22.802
I am a doctor. Please give way.

215
00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:24.721
sir look at me

216
00:13:28.641 --> 00:13:30.393
Breathe here

217
00:13:30.476 --> 00:13:32.020
take a deep breath

218
00:13:34.439 --> 00:13:35.440
continue

219
00:13:38.067 --> 00:13:39.986
Yes, I'm in front of Wangzhen Shopping Center

220
00:13:40.528 --> 00:13:42.030
someone fell

221
00:13:43.823 --> 00:13:45.491
There were no patients that day

222
00:13:45.575 --> 00:13:47.452
I just kept looking out the window and happened to see

223
00:13:47.535 --> 00:13:50.288
I just did my duty

224
00:13:50.371 --> 00:13:52.832
So don't thank me

225
00:13:54.667 --> 00:13:55.668
(Graduation certificate, professional qualification certificate)

226
00:13:55.752 --> 00:13:57.337
I was admitted second

227
00:13:57.420 --> 00:13:58.629
Graduated first

228
00:13:58.713 --> 00:14:00.256
(Graduation Certificate Psychiatry)

229
00:14:01.007 --> 00:14:02.550
I didn't ask

230
00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:05.720
Anyway

231
00:14:06.304 --> 00:14:09.724
As a psychiatrist, my diagnosis is

232
00:14:09.807 --> 00:14:10.933
you have panic disorder

233
00:14:16.356 --> 00:14:17.732
you have panic disorder

234
00:14:20.026 --> 00:14:20.985
Oops

235
00:14:23.196 --> 00:14:24.113
ok

236
00:14:24.906 --> 00:14:26.491
Let’s call it “disease”

237
00:14:26.574 --> 00:14:29.118
Cold, enteritis, muscle pain

238
00:14:29.202 --> 00:14:31.454
And panic disorder, they are all diseases.

239
00:14:33.498 --> 00:14:35.208
As long as I change my mentality

240
00:14:35.291 --> 00:14:37.752
Be optimistic and live in a temple

241
00:14:38.252 --> 00:14:39.545
Wouldn't it be nice to exercise?

242
00:14:39.629 --> 00:14:42.382
No, this is not a disease that can be cured by willpower alone.

243
00:14:43.091 --> 00:14:45.009
So what can I do to get better?

244
00:14:46.469 --> 00:14:48.638
Let's take our time. Let's have a cup of tea first.

245
00:14:49.305 --> 00:14:50.932
So can tea cure panic disorder?

246
00:14:52.183 --> 00:14:53.309
No. That kind of tea does not exist.

247
00:14:53.393 --> 00:14:54.977
Then I won’t drink

248
00:14:57.730 --> 00:14:58.689
ok

249
00:14:59.232 --> 00:15:02.735
drug treatment
Cognitive behavioral therapy and breathing exercises

250
00:15:02.819 --> 00:15:05.279
The treatment of panic disorder goes like this step by step...

251
00:15:05.363 --> 00:15:07.115
I don't have time to do this now

252
00:15:07.198 --> 00:15:08.449
you know

253
00:15:08.533 --> 00:15:10.201
I still have to take care of that damn store.

254
00:15:10.284 --> 00:15:12.662
I don't have time to do this

255
00:15:12.745 --> 00:15:15.373
- How did you take care of it?
- I have to clean every day

256
00:15:15.456 --> 00:15:17.500
It’s so convenient to rent.

257
00:15:17.583 --> 00:15:20.253
Do you really think it says "rent free for the first three months"?

258
00:15:20.336 --> 00:15:22.213
Can it attract tenants?

259
00:15:25.550 --> 00:15:27.802
So why did you come here to open a clinic?

260
00:15:27.885 --> 00:15:29.804
How much is the monthly rent?

261
00:15:32.807 --> 00:15:34.517
- I don’t pay monthly rent
- What?

262
00:15:35.476 --> 00:15:37.937
I heard that a chain of coffee shops is planning to set up shop.
Are you excited?

263
00:15:38.020 --> 00:15:40.356
- Right
-“Comparable to the business district of Gangnam Station”

264
00:15:40.440 --> 00:15:44.360
“Three minutes walk to the subway station”
"The director will give you the best discount"

265
00:15:45.069 --> 00:15:47.321
- Right
- When you said you wanted to buy it

266
00:15:47.405 --> 00:15:49.824
He also asked you to discuss it with your family before coming.

267
00:15:49.907 --> 00:15:50.825
Yes

268
00:15:50.908 --> 00:15:53.119
He clicks on his tablet and calculator

269
00:15:53.202 --> 00:15:55.455
It must be that posture that frightened you, right?

270
00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:57.373
don't tell me...

271
00:15:58.708 --> 00:15:59.709
Yes

272
00:16:02.420 --> 00:16:05.131
I was also one of the first people to buy a shop here

273
00:16:07.925 --> 00:16:09.051
Damn it

274
00:16:10.803 --> 00:16:11.804
Oops

275
00:16:16.517 --> 00:16:17.810
let's go

276
00:16:17.894 --> 00:16:19.020
Hurry up

277
00:16:19.103 --> 00:16:20.480
Sorry, I have to pay

278
00:16:20.563 --> 00:16:22.064
Bring your medicine too

279
00:16:22.148 --> 00:16:23.024
- OK
- OK

280
00:16:29.030 --> 00:16:29.906
(Wangzhen Shopping Center)

281
00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:32.450
Isn't this the clinic you insisted on coming to?

282
00:16:32.533 --> 00:16:33.618
What's wrong?

283
00:16:33.701 --> 00:16:34.702
Listen, wife

284
00:16:34.785 --> 00:16:37.497
The doctor must at least be smarter than me, right?

285
00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:39.957
- Right
- That way I can feel free to let him see me.

286
00:16:40.041 --> 00:16:41.250
What then?

287
00:16:41.918 --> 00:16:43.711
I think he's as stupid as me

288
00:16:44.253 --> 00:16:45.296
I can't trust that guy

289
00:16:45.963 --> 00:16:48.174
What on earth did you two talk about?

290
00:16:48.674 --> 00:16:50.051
Boss!

291
00:16:50.134 --> 00:16:51.010
Boss!

292
00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:55.097
- Boss!
- Oh, let's go

293
00:16:55.181 --> 00:16:57.266
- Is she calling you? She...
- Where are you going?

294
00:16:57.808 --> 00:16:59.185
Why don't you answer my call?

295
00:16:59.268 --> 00:17:00.811
Did you admit the wrong person?

296
00:17:00.895 --> 00:17:03.439
I finally waited for a phone call
He said he would come over tomorrow to have a look

297
00:17:03.981 --> 00:17:05.608
- That...
- What do you say?

298
00:17:05.691 --> 00:17:06.776
Just...

299
00:17:06.859 --> 00:17:09.111
I remembered

300
00:17:09.195 --> 00:17:11.864
I resigned from ACT

301
00:17:11.948 --> 00:17:14.367
She is the boss of the company I worked with before

302
00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:16.786
- She must not know that I have resigned.
- What are you talking about?

303
00:17:16.869 --> 00:17:18.579
Someone wants to see No. 102

304
00:17:20.581 --> 00:17:21.499
No. 102?

305
00:17:21.582 --> 00:17:23.709
Are you his wife?

306
00:17:23.793 --> 00:17:25.545
You must be worried, right?

307
00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:28.839
You have to be nice to your wife. If something like this happens...

308
00:17:28.923 --> 00:17:30.216
What?

309
00:17:31.008 --> 00:17:32.510
I understand

310
00:17:33.135 --> 00:17:34.428
I'll contact you tomorrow

311
00:17:38.641 --> 00:17:40.309
The first three months are rent-free, right?

312
00:17:40.393 --> 00:17:41.435
Yes

313
00:17:45.439 --> 00:17:46.899
(Recruitment: 3 million won per month)

314
00:17:46.983 --> 00:17:49.694
(The first three months are rent-free!
Catering, Coffee, Unmanned Stores (Preferred)

315
00:18:16.387 --> 00:18:17.597
Did you buy this?

316
00:18:23.561 --> 00:18:24.812
How much?

317
00:18:28.691 --> 00:18:29.859
billion

318
00:18:30.401 --> 00:18:31.819
fifty million

319
00:18:35.531 --> 00:18:36.407
Wait

320
00:18:39.285 --> 00:18:41.245
Where did that money come from?

321
00:18:43.456 --> 00:18:47.043
I took out a loan of 550 million

322
00:18:48.711 --> 00:18:49.837
What else?

323
00:18:50.463 --> 00:18:51.672
Another 500 million...

324
00:18:56.677 --> 00:18:57.845
It's retirement pay

325
00:19:01.641 --> 00:19:02.683
severance pay...

326
00:19:02.767 --> 00:19:05.436
This is our one billion and fifty million won store

327
00:19:06.020 --> 00:19:08.397
I will try my best. I'm sorry.

328
00:19:09.065 --> 00:19:10.316
Kim Nak Soo

329
00:19:10.399 --> 00:19:12.318
I wanted to tell you, but I never had the chance

330
00:19:12.985 --> 00:19:14.195
Kim Nak Soo!

331
00:19:15.279 --> 00:19:16.906
- Kim Nak-soo
- Sorry

332
00:19:16.989 --> 00:19:18.491
Please Kim Nak Soo

333
00:19:18.574 --> 00:19:20.076
Kim Nak Soo

334
00:19:20.618 --> 00:19:22.036
Kim Nak Soo!

335
00:19:22.119 --> 00:19:24.330
Kim Nak Soo!

336
00:19:24.413 --> 00:19:27.208
Kim Nak Soo!

337
00:19:33.005 --> 00:19:34.382
sorry

338
00:19:34.465 --> 00:19:36.592
Kim Nak Soo!

339
00:19:38.219 --> 00:19:40.638
Accept the reality and confess to your family

340
00:19:41.931 --> 00:19:43.015
That's it

341
00:19:44.183 --> 00:19:46.060
well done

342
00:19:47.853 --> 00:19:49.855
(3208333 won)

343
00:20:00.199 --> 00:20:01.117
give me one

344
00:20:03.661 --> 00:20:04.704
Why are you doing this?

345
00:20:04.787 --> 00:20:07.039
Ever since I got pregnant with Soo-gyeom, I haven’t had a smoking habit in 20 years.

346
00:20:07.123 --> 00:20:08.749
But now I want to smoke like crazy

347
00:20:08.833 --> 00:20:10.167
Give me one quickly

348
00:20:11.210 --> 00:20:13.337
Sorry, please don't do this

349
00:20:19.009 --> 00:20:20.052
What about stocks?

350
00:20:22.304 --> 00:20:23.347
i sold

351
00:20:23.431 --> 00:20:25.307
Have you sold both US and Korean stocks?

352
00:20:32.064 --> 00:20:33.315
Where did that money go?

353
00:20:39.697 --> 00:20:41.699
(mom)

354
00:20:44.243 --> 00:20:47.079
(No. 517, Dongcheon-daero, Sinpyeong-si, Gyeonggi-do
Wangzhen Shopping Center)

355
00:20:49.039 --> 00:20:51.625
Go straight and then turn left. Hey Soo-gyeom.

356
00:20:52.168 --> 00:20:53.961
This way

357
00:20:57.506 --> 00:20:58.883
Dad, what is this place?

358
00:21:08.350 --> 00:21:09.769
Soo Gyeom is here

359
00:21:17.943 --> 00:21:18.819
Kim Soo-gyeom

360
00:21:18.903 --> 00:21:20.154
Huh?

361
00:21:20.237 --> 00:21:23.574
your company representative
I borrowed 30 million in your name?

362
00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:30.706
Really?

363
00:21:35.419 --> 00:21:36.295
Yes

364
00:21:36.378 --> 00:21:38.255
So in order to pay off the debt

365
00:21:38.339 --> 00:21:40.883
You use the money your father gave you to start a business?

366
00:21:41.926 --> 00:21:43.093
Yes

367
00:21:50.017 --> 00:21:52.686
- OK
- Where are you going?

368
00:21:56.565 --> 00:21:59.068
Do you two consider me family?

369
00:21:59.777 --> 00:22:01.070
Of course there is

370
00:22:01.153 --> 00:22:03.697
But so much money comes and goes...

371
00:22:04.782 --> 00:22:06.408
How could you not discuss it with me once?

372
00:22:08.077 --> 00:22:10.621
What do you want me to do now?

373
00:22:14.625 --> 00:22:15.793
I don't know

374
00:22:16.502 --> 00:22:17.962
I really don't know anything anymore

375
00:22:19.296 --> 00:22:20.297
You go...

376
00:22:22.591 --> 00:22:23.509
Wife

377
00:22:24.552 --> 00:22:27.471
Dad, what's going on?

378
00:22:28.389 --> 00:22:31.225
How did things become like this?

379
00:22:33.227 --> 00:22:34.979
What is this place?

380
00:22:46.115 --> 00:22:47.575
We can't go home for the time being.

381
00:23:08.888 --> 00:23:10.514
Lazy guy, where are you?

382
00:23:11.390 --> 00:23:12.266
Traveling?

383
00:23:12.766 --> 00:23:14.226
So your house is empty?

384
00:23:15.060 --> 00:23:16.645
Your daughter didn't go with you

385
00:23:16.729 --> 00:23:19.607
Hey, didn’t you say last time that the third floor was empty?

386
00:23:20.232 --> 00:23:22.943
Can Suqian and I stay here tonight?

387
00:23:23.986 --> 00:23:24.987
Has anyone rented it?

388
00:23:25.529 --> 00:23:28.198
Wow, it looks like a geomantic treasure.
Your building is never empty

389
00:23:28.282 --> 00:23:29.533
OK, have fun.

390
00:23:30.075 --> 00:23:31.076
good

391
00:23:34.455 --> 00:23:35.497
Hey

392
00:23:37.124 --> 00:23:39.209
Let's go to the jjimjilbang

393
00:23:39.752 --> 00:23:41.587
Go there to discuss countermeasures

394
00:23:42.880 --> 00:23:44.048
Let's go

395
00:23:49.345 --> 00:23:50.262
Hello

396
00:23:51.055 --> 00:23:53.891
Are you blaming me for snitching on my mother?

397
00:23:55.893 --> 00:23:57.686
So what else can I do?

398
00:23:58.395 --> 00:24:01.273
She grilled me like a tax inspector

399
00:24:01.357 --> 00:24:03.275
I have to confess

400
00:24:03.359 --> 00:24:04.568
Get up, let's go

401
00:24:07.404 --> 00:24:09.573
I really don't understand you

402
00:24:10.908 --> 00:24:12.284
What does it mean?

403
00:24:21.543 --> 00:24:22.878
you really are

404
00:24:24.338 --> 00:24:28.217
Is it an investment made for the sake of my mother and me?

405
00:24:29.510 --> 00:24:30.678
Ouch

406
00:24:36.850 --> 00:24:38.811
Do you want to show off to others?

407
00:24:40.354 --> 00:24:42.982
"Even if you are kicked out of the company
I’m still doing fine.”

408
00:24:43.065 --> 00:24:44.775
You want to prove yourself

409
00:24:45.275 --> 00:24:46.652
Right? Dad

410
00:24:49.029 --> 00:24:51.365
That's enough. Stop talking.

411
00:24:52.032 --> 00:24:53.367
You boy

412
00:24:57.454 --> 00:25:01.291
That's what you said when you asked me to repeat the reading.

413
00:25:02.376 --> 00:25:05.629
You say it's all for my own good, but in the end...

414
00:25:07.381 --> 00:25:09.091
You are just coveting

415
00:25:10.050 --> 00:25:11.969
It’s just the title “Father of Seoul National University Students”

416
00:25:12.553 --> 00:25:13.762
Isn't it?

417
00:25:16.557 --> 00:25:18.308
You bastard

418
00:25:18.392 --> 00:25:20.811
What does the family want?

419
00:25:21.478 --> 00:25:23.313
What are you worried about...

420
00:25:26.025 --> 00:25:27.776
You never understood and you never cared

421
00:25:29.778 --> 00:25:33.073
Whether it's Seoul National University or this store...

422
00:25:37.745 --> 00:25:39.663
None of this is what we want, Dad.

423
00:26:20.037 --> 00:26:22.539
You worry: “I won’t die, right?
What should I do if it happens again next time?”

424
00:26:22.623 --> 00:26:25.751
So you will make small changes to your body
have become extremely sensitive

425
00:26:25.834 --> 00:26:29.463
Even if the heartbeat is just a little faster
Or breathing a little bit faster

426
00:26:29.546 --> 00:26:30.464
You will all think...

427
00:26:41.642 --> 00:26:44.436
Madam, this location is around the corner.

428
00:26:44.520 --> 00:26:46.063
It can not only attract the flow of customers here,

429
00:26:46.146 --> 00:26:48.023
And it can attract customers over there.

430
00:26:48.107 --> 00:26:50.025
Take your time and watch

431
00:26:51.777 --> 00:26:54.488
This shop has been vacant since I bought it, right?

432
00:26:54.571 --> 00:26:55.447
Yes but...

433
00:26:55.531 --> 00:26:57.157
Someone who can truly see its value

434
00:26:57.241 --> 00:26:58.575
Not here yet

435
00:27:00.744 --> 00:27:01.954
Yes

436
00:27:02.037 --> 00:27:03.497
Thank you. I've finished reading.

437
00:27:03.580 --> 00:27:06.333
OK, walk slowly and look forward to your wise decision.

438
00:27:06.416 --> 00:27:07.459
Remember to contact us

439
00:27:07.543 --> 00:27:09.920
Please wait here for a moment, don't leave yet

440
00:27:14.508 --> 00:27:17.719
Did I say the wrong thing in front of your wife?

441
00:27:17.803 --> 00:27:19.054
It's okay It's okay

442
00:27:19.138 --> 00:27:21.265
It's only been a few days and you're already so haggard

443
00:27:21.348 --> 00:27:22.766
Wipe the shit out of your eyes

444
00:27:22.850 --> 00:27:24.309
Shave your beard too

445
00:27:24.393 --> 00:27:26.353
Okay, please...

446
00:27:26.436 --> 00:27:27.312
Good

447
00:27:27.396 --> 00:27:29.648
- Really
- Remember to contact me

448
00:27:29.731 --> 00:27:30.774
OK I will

449
00:27:31.900 --> 00:27:33.944
Madam, don't just leave like that

450
00:27:34.027 --> 00:27:35.988
I'll show you other places

451
00:27:45.497 --> 00:27:46.540
Oops

452
00:27:54.840 --> 00:27:55.883
Oh my god

453
00:27:58.760 --> 00:27:59.720
Huh?

454
00:28:04.141 --> 00:28:05.267
What are you doing?

455
00:28:09.104 --> 00:28:10.063
Oops

456
00:28:11.356 --> 00:28:12.649
Damn it

457
00:28:15.527 --> 00:28:17.321
Are you sleeping here again?

458
00:28:19.613 --> 00:28:20.949
What...

459
00:28:21.033 --> 00:28:22.492
No more water

460
00:28:23.285 --> 00:28:25.204
God, this building is really hopeless.

461
00:28:25.287 --> 00:28:27.539
Sorry, Dr. Luo

462
00:28:30.083 --> 00:28:32.252
I was so rude yesterday

463
00:28:33.962 --> 00:28:35.214
Dr. Luo

464
00:28:35.881 --> 00:28:37.966
Can you help me?

465
00:28:40.677 --> 00:28:41.970
My eyes hurt so much

466
00:28:43.430 --> 00:28:44.306
Dr. Luo

467
00:28:45.224 --> 00:28:46.725
(natural mineral water)

468
00:28:46.808 --> 00:28:48.185
So cool

469
00:28:48.852 --> 00:28:50.187
Something bad almost happened

470
00:28:50.812 --> 00:28:53.565
Thanks to you, I can wash my hair. Thank you.

471
00:28:55.943 --> 00:28:58.403
After confessing to my wife

472
00:28:59.529 --> 00:29:00.489
Feeling better?

473
00:29:02.032 --> 00:29:03.116
How do you know?

474
00:29:03.200 --> 00:29:04.117
I didn't mean to eavesdrop

475
00:29:05.535 --> 00:29:07.037
There was always a sound outside, so I heard it

476
00:29:07.120 --> 00:29:08.872
What kind of terrible hobby do you have?

477
00:29:10.624 --> 00:29:14.253
do you remember
When was the first panic attack?

478
00:29:18.090 --> 00:29:20.842
You might get into a serious accident

479
00:29:22.344 --> 00:29:23.679
Panic disorder itself is not fatal

480
00:29:23.762 --> 00:29:24.763
But

481
00:29:25.305 --> 00:29:26.974
If in an emergency

482
00:29:27.599 --> 00:29:29.685
What about sudden panic attacks?

483
00:29:29.768 --> 00:29:31.436
Damn it

484
00:29:31.520 --> 00:29:33.522
I'm telling you to scold him!

485
00:29:33.605 --> 00:29:34.481
scold him!

486
00:29:34.564 --> 00:29:35.816
Hello!

487
00:29:37.651 --> 00:29:38.944
(Construction ahead, slow down)

488
00:29:40.612 --> 00:29:42.948
Your whole life will collapse in an instant

489
00:29:48.912 --> 00:29:49.788
that

490
00:29:50.956 --> 00:29:52.958
My wife and I don't talk much about work.

491
00:29:53.041 --> 00:29:56.128
Not to mention my son and...

492
00:29:56.753 --> 00:29:58.463
Oops

493
00:29:58.547 --> 00:30:01.425
Sitting face to face with a complete stranger

494
00:30:01.508 --> 00:30:04.886
Talking about my own affairs and doing consultation...

495
00:30:04.970 --> 00:30:06.596
I really can't do it

496
00:30:06.680 --> 00:30:08.348
If it really doesn't work...

497
00:30:10.434 --> 00:30:12.311
Then we

498
00:30:13.937 --> 00:30:14.938
Change the place?

499
00:30:19.067 --> 00:30:20.277
(Dr. Luo Dalong)

500
00:30:23.155 --> 00:30:24.698
{\an8}(Huiyin Psychiatric Clinic)

501
00:30:24.781 --> 00:30:26.116
{\an8}Aren't you coming back?

502
00:30:26.199 --> 00:30:27.326
{\an8}I am seeing a doctor

503
00:30:32.831 --> 00:30:33.874
What then?

504
00:30:48.472 --> 00:30:49.556
Anyway...

505
00:30:52.017 --> 00:30:56.688
He and I joined the company at the same time

506
00:30:58.065 --> 00:31:01.735
That guy has been a class principal all his life

507
00:31:02.319 --> 00:31:03.737
then the company

508
00:31:04.946 --> 00:31:07.240
Suddenly asked him to go to Ulleungdo

509
00:31:08.825 --> 00:31:10.160
a few days later

510
00:31:10.744 --> 00:31:13.747
He's in the company's underground parking lot
Lighted charcoal in his car

511
00:31:16.958 --> 00:31:18.168
So that's it

512
00:31:18.251 --> 00:31:22.214
From then on, whenever something happened at work,

513
00:31:23.757 --> 00:31:26.009
I feel like it's hard to breathe

514
00:31:26.093 --> 00:31:29.096
My chest feels like it's being strangled tightly

515
00:31:29.179 --> 00:31:30.430
That's it

516
00:31:31.306 --> 00:31:32.307
I understand

517
00:31:35.769 --> 00:31:37.437
How big companies do things

518
00:31:38.397 --> 00:31:43.318
It's really frustrating, you know?

519
00:31:43.402 --> 00:31:45.237
The boss keeps putting pressure

520
00:31:45.320 --> 00:31:47.531
The subordinates tried their best to climb up again

521
00:31:47.614 --> 00:31:48.532
Oh my god

522
00:31:50.242 --> 00:31:53.245
You probably don’t understand this feeling, right?

523
00:31:55.539 --> 00:31:56.415
Minister Kim

524
00:31:56.957 --> 00:31:59.751
I used to work at a university hospital

525
00:32:00.460 --> 00:32:01.670
So what?

526
00:32:02.504 --> 00:32:04.965
Factions, sides, workplace politics

527
00:32:06.550 --> 00:32:08.510
It's the same over there too

528
00:32:09.386 --> 00:32:12.556
Yes, I saw it on TV

529
00:32:13.098 --> 00:32:15.600
Is the situation so bad where you are?

530
00:32:19.104 --> 00:32:20.355
Really?

531
00:32:21.481 --> 00:32:23.275
Don't talk about me anyway...

532
00:32:23.358 --> 00:32:24.401
Tell me

533
00:32:24.484 --> 00:32:26.153
Why did you resign?

534
00:32:26.236 --> 00:32:27.404
Huh?

535
00:32:28.029 --> 00:32:31.950
Could it be that your trusted senior betrayed you?

536
00:32:32.033 --> 00:32:33.326
Really?

537
00:32:34.369 --> 00:32:36.163
enough

538
00:32:36.246 --> 00:32:38.290
Tell me about you

539
00:32:45.255 --> 00:32:47.090
I really put my seniors

540
00:32:48.175 --> 00:32:52.846
Treat him like a real brother, even closer than my real brother

541
00:32:52.929 --> 00:32:54.764
For 25 years...

542
00:32:57.767 --> 00:33:00.020
Hear you say that

543
00:33:00.562 --> 00:33:04.441
I think store fraud was just the final trigger.

544
00:33:04.524 --> 00:33:07.194
While still working in the company
The situation has seriously deteriorated

545
00:33:07.277 --> 00:33:09.029
I'm talking about your mental state.

546
00:33:09.571 --> 00:33:10.739
for koreans

547
00:33:10.822 --> 00:33:14.284
The most stressful place is the workplace

548
00:33:14.784 --> 00:33:17.829
Competing all the way from elementary school, middle school, and college entrance examination

549
00:33:17.913 --> 00:33:20.040
Competing genes in our body

550
00:33:20.123 --> 00:33:22.626
Full bloom in the workplace

551
00:33:23.210 --> 00:33:25.795
I don't feel pressured by competition.

552
00:33:27.881 --> 00:33:30.842
Yes, indeed some people would say that.

553
00:33:31.384 --> 00:33:32.636
No, I mean it

554
00:33:32.719 --> 00:33:35.263
I have felt that competition is part of life since I was a child

555
00:33:36.515 --> 00:33:39.267
I compete with my brother at home

556
00:33:40.644 --> 00:33:42.229
What do you compete with your brother for?

557
00:33:42.312 --> 00:33:43.355
Results

558
00:33:44.272 --> 00:33:45.524
Is your brother studying well?

559
00:33:45.607 --> 00:33:47.943
Come on, he's always been number one.

560
00:33:48.026 --> 00:33:50.654
He is also always the class president and student council president, which is quite impressive.

561
00:33:50.737 --> 00:33:53.615
As the eldest son, he is naturally more favored

562
00:33:53.698 --> 00:33:57.160
Studying is so good
My brother must always take priority at home, right?

563
00:33:57.786 --> 00:34:00.622
My parents also secretly encourage this competition.

564
00:34:01.373 --> 00:34:04.834
"To be recognized like your brother

565
00:34:04.918 --> 00:34:06.294
You also have to show some results."

566
00:34:06.378 --> 00:34:09.464
What about your brother later?
Went to a better university than you?

567
00:34:09.548 --> 00:34:10.590
No

568
00:34:11.216 --> 00:34:13.927
He repeated his studies for three years
Finally, I went to a private university abroad.

569
00:34:14.469 --> 00:34:17.347
My job is better than his too

570
00:34:20.725 --> 00:34:22.185
That means you win

571
00:34:24.771 --> 00:34:26.481
At that time

572
00:34:27.148 --> 00:34:28.275
How do you feel?

573
00:34:37.409 --> 00:34:38.952
That's it for today

574
00:34:46.167 --> 00:34:47.752
Is this the last one?

575
00:34:47.836 --> 00:34:48.837
Yes

576
00:34:50.547 --> 00:34:52.340
There's a lot left

577
00:34:53.717 --> 00:34:56.720
Sorry, I will find another place to store it as soon as possible.

578
00:34:59.848 --> 00:35:03.643
What are those at the back? Did you draw them?

579
00:35:06.187 --> 00:35:08.773
My current roommate is an art student

580
00:35:08.857 --> 00:35:11.985
I just paint casually as a hobby

581
00:35:13.445 --> 00:35:14.904
Can I have a look?

582
00:35:14.988 --> 00:35:16.072
Of course

583
00:35:24.164 --> 00:35:25.165
wow

584
00:35:28.335 --> 00:35:30.337
Which paintings did you paint?

585
00:35:30.420 --> 00:35:34.841
This one and...the ones here are all painted by me.

586
00:35:40.221 --> 00:35:42.265
Hannah, this is more than just a hobby.

587
00:35:44.017 --> 00:35:45.101
- Really?
- Yeah

588
00:35:45.185 --> 00:35:48.104
There's something special about your paintings...

589
00:35:49.564 --> 00:35:50.440
Something special?

590
00:35:51.733 --> 00:35:52.984
Is there any?

591
00:36:00.950 --> 00:36:03.328
Hannah, do you want these pictures?

592
00:36:04.579 --> 00:36:05.664
On our hoodies?

593
00:36:07.582 --> 00:36:08.958
- This?
- Right

594
00:36:09.626 --> 00:36:11.086
No, it's so embarrassing

595
00:36:11.670 --> 00:36:13.254
These are not yet ready to be sold.

596
00:36:13.338 --> 00:36:14.506
No

597
00:36:15.632 --> 00:36:17.926
Please, it's much better than this

598
00:36:20.178 --> 00:36:21.179
That's true

599
00:36:21.262 --> 00:36:22.722
(Love is here)

600
00:36:28.728 --> 00:36:30.772
Have you ever thought about studying art?

601
00:36:30.855 --> 00:36:34.025
I've thought about it. I like painting very much.

602
00:36:34.109 --> 00:36:36.695
I have also applied to several design schools

603
00:36:36.778 --> 00:36:38.029
How many have been admitted?

604
00:36:39.280 --> 00:36:40.156
That's it

605
00:36:40.949 --> 00:36:41.825
What happened next?

606
00:36:41.908 --> 00:36:44.160
My dad wants me to repeat my studies for another year

607
00:36:44.244 --> 00:36:47.914
I ended up going to Michigan Tech
That's not where I should be at all

608
00:36:47.997 --> 00:36:49.499
you know

609
00:36:52.419 --> 00:36:54.546
Why are parents like this?

610
00:36:54.629 --> 00:36:56.464
The problem is their approach

611
00:36:58.717 --> 00:37:01.177
I think that is also a kind of love

612
00:37:02.011 --> 00:37:04.139
Because they probably grew up that way too

613
00:37:05.265 --> 00:37:07.350
So I can only express it in that way.

614
00:37:24.367 --> 00:37:26.703
Okay, I want three sample clothes first.

615
00:37:32.625 --> 00:37:35.920
Okay, I'll see you then. Thank you.

616
00:37:39.799 --> 00:37:40.967
Said let's pick it up next week

617
00:37:42.594 --> 00:37:45.680
Your mobility is so strong

618
00:37:48.516 --> 00:37:50.310
I'm leaving

619
00:37:50.393 --> 00:37:52.937
Where are you going to sleep tonight?

620
00:37:55.398 --> 00:37:57.817
I plan to go to the jjimjilbang

621
00:37:58.485 --> 00:38:00.028
Internet cafes are not very...

622
00:38:02.530 --> 00:38:04.324
Do you want to sleep here?

623
00:38:07.660 --> 00:38:08.620
What?

624
00:38:09.579 --> 00:38:10.538
Damn it

625
00:38:12.123 --> 00:38:13.792
- boss
- What's wrong? Are you in a hurry?

626
00:38:14.334 --> 00:38:15.293
No, no rush

627
00:38:15.376 --> 00:38:17.003
someone is looking for you

628
00:38:17.962 --> 00:38:19.088
Oops

629
00:38:20.632 --> 00:38:22.258
(Complete car maintenance)

630
00:38:22.342 --> 00:38:23.426
Who?

631
00:38:24.052 --> 00:38:25.261
That one

632
00:38:28.056 --> 00:38:29.516
- You go to work first
- It's the boss

633
00:38:31.059 --> 00:38:32.227
Haojun

634
00:38:38.066 --> 00:38:39.150
Hey!

635
00:38:40.151 --> 00:38:41.820
Kim Nak-soo, Managing Director

636
00:38:47.408 --> 00:38:49.202
Is there anything less sweet?

637
00:38:51.913 --> 00:38:53.581
Is the car owner here for a regular inspection?

638
00:38:53.665 --> 00:38:54.666
(maintenance record)

639
00:38:54.749 --> 00:38:57.293
I checked the maintenance records
Just need to replace the tires

640
00:38:57.377 --> 00:38:58.628
good

641
00:39:02.257 --> 00:39:03.591
Want to try it?

642
00:39:04.467 --> 00:39:05.385
No more

643
00:39:05.468 --> 00:39:07.303
You can learn how to change a tire in ten minutes

644
00:39:07.387 --> 00:39:09.138
Just like building with Lego

645
00:39:09.222 --> 00:39:10.306
Forget it. Why bother?

646
00:39:12.183 --> 00:39:14.060
Is this job profitable?

647
00:39:15.103 --> 00:39:16.354
Sometimes it's not bad

648
00:39:16.437 --> 00:39:18.773
Sometimes I earn less than them

649
00:39:19.691 --> 00:39:21.651
Yongji, it's getting late. Let's call it a day.

650
00:39:21.734 --> 00:39:22.777
good boss

651
00:39:23.278 --> 00:39:24.279
good

652
00:39:26.531 --> 00:39:27.824
Let's go after dinner, right?

653
00:39:28.700 --> 00:39:29.576
I'm not hungry

654
00:39:30.994 --> 00:39:32.579
Then what are you here for?

655
00:39:32.662 --> 00:39:34.747
I see there seems to be a sofa over there

656
00:39:34.831 --> 00:39:37.166
- What?
- Can I sleep here for one night?

657
00:39:39.043 --> 00:39:41.087
- Did you quarrel with your siblings?
- OK or not?

658
00:39:55.268 --> 00:39:56.436
are you asleep?

659
00:39:56.519 --> 00:39:58.646
What? Nothing. What happened?

660
00:40:19.751 --> 00:40:20.793
thank you

661
00:40:24.005 --> 00:40:25.089
Thank you for what?

662
00:40:27.175 --> 00:40:31.095
I have always been envious
My roommate can hold a solo exhibition

663
00:40:32.347 --> 00:40:36.267
But now it’s you who made me paint
appeared for the first time

664
00:40:39.938 --> 00:40:41.898
thank you really

665
00:40:47.153 --> 00:40:48.237
can i...

666
00:40:50.740 --> 00:40:52.367
Come closer?

667
00:40:53.242 --> 00:40:54.118
What?

668
00:40:56.162 --> 00:40:57.413
I have something to say

669
00:41:15.890 --> 00:41:17.684
How close do you want to get?

670
00:41:18.434 --> 00:41:21.604
I want to muster up some courage

671
00:41:23.648 --> 00:41:25.024
you know...

672
00:41:28.069 --> 00:41:28.945
If...

673
00:41:31.531 --> 00:41:33.032
without your words

674
00:41:35.201 --> 00:41:37.286
I can't do anything

675
00:41:39.205 --> 00:41:40.289
you...

676
00:41:42.542 --> 00:41:43.418
let me...

677
00:41:45.461 --> 00:41:48.715
want to be a better person

678
00:41:52.343 --> 00:41:54.929
i am very grateful to you

679
00:41:58.099 --> 00:41:59.225
I like it very much

680
00:42:00.393 --> 00:42:03.062
so i hope we

681
00:42:04.605 --> 00:42:06.149
Can we keep going like this?

682
00:42:27.420 --> 00:42:31.382
Then you have to go to bed early

683
00:42:38.848 --> 00:42:39.932
good night

684
00:42:40.683 --> 00:42:41.559
good

685
00:42:42.310 --> 00:42:43.561
You too

686
00:42:58.367 --> 00:43:00.161
(Speedmate Auto Repair
Tire service (entrust with confidence)

687
00:43:07.376 --> 00:43:09.921
You can sleep at my house

688
00:43:10.004 --> 00:43:11.255
Oops, I don't want to go

689
00:43:13.591 --> 00:43:14.592
Have you cheated?

690
00:43:14.675 --> 00:43:16.219
please

691
00:43:16.844 --> 00:43:19.972
Yeah, you can't do such a thing

692
00:43:21.057 --> 00:43:22.141
Where is Soo Gyeom?

693
00:43:22.225 --> 00:43:23.976
I heard he repeated his studies

694
00:43:25.728 --> 00:43:27.021
He went to Yanxi University

695
00:43:27.105 --> 00:43:28.940
Really? Wow

696
00:43:29.023 --> 00:43:31.526
He is the first one in our family to be admitted to three prestigious universities.

697
00:43:31.609 --> 00:43:32.819
Hey, give him a call?

698
00:43:32.902 --> 00:43:34.612
Let me talk to him. I haven't talked to him in a long time.

699
00:43:34.695 --> 00:43:35.822
Forget it

700
00:43:36.864 --> 00:43:40.409
You also have some time
Haven’t you seen my Xiaojun and Ruiren?

701
00:43:42.870 --> 00:43:44.247
look

702
00:43:44.330 --> 00:43:46.332
The children have grown so big

703
00:43:50.711 --> 00:43:52.171
Say something, brat

704
00:44:04.684 --> 00:44:07.812
Did you later become a senior executive?

705
00:44:08.980 --> 00:44:10.690
I resigned

706
00:44:12.775 --> 00:44:13.943
What?

707
00:44:17.113 --> 00:44:18.698
You've worked there long enough

708
00:44:22.910 --> 00:44:24.162
I was fired

709
00:44:25.037 --> 00:44:26.831
Demoted to factory

710
00:44:26.914 --> 00:44:29.709
He always disobeyed orders there too

711
00:44:29.792 --> 00:44:31.043
So he was kicked out

712
00:44:35.089 --> 00:44:36.549
heard this

713
00:44:37.258 --> 00:44:38.384
How do you feel?

714
00:44:39.594 --> 00:44:40.887
What do you mean?

715
00:44:40.970 --> 00:44:44.098
I heard that I was not promoted to a senior executive in the end.
He was fired by the company

716
00:44:44.182 --> 00:44:45.933
How do you feel?

717
00:44:48.477 --> 00:44:50.479
I was just wondering how much severance pay you got

718
00:44:50.563 --> 00:44:53.774
I took 500 million won
It all ended up being a stupid thing.

719
00:44:54.901 --> 00:44:57.945
How do you feel? How do you feel when you hear this?

720
00:44:58.029 --> 00:44:59.822
What on earth do you want to say?

721
00:44:59.906 --> 00:45:02.408
You didn't get admitted to Seoul National University

722
00:45:04.744 --> 00:45:06.162
I'm very happy

723
00:45:07.121 --> 00:45:10.249
International Monetary Fund Crisis
You were laid off from your company

724
00:45:10.333 --> 00:45:12.835
And when you lose everything in business

725
00:45:13.502 --> 00:45:15.296
To be honest, I'm really happy

726
00:45:16.797 --> 00:45:19.759
How is it? Have you changed your mind now?

727
00:45:25.389 --> 00:45:26.724
I don't know

728
00:45:34.607 --> 00:45:38.069
When I was a child, my mother once bought bananas.

729
00:45:39.528 --> 00:45:40.571
Banana?

730
00:45:40.655 --> 00:45:42.573
Bananas were very valuable back then

731
00:45:44.825 --> 00:45:48.788
One string is about 100,000 won in today’s currency.

732
00:45:49.997 --> 00:45:51.582
Mom gave me two

733
00:45:52.500 --> 00:45:53.834
I gave you three

734
00:45:55.419 --> 00:45:59.428
But when I got home from school, there was only one left on the table.

735
00:46:00.132 --> 00:46:01.384
I'll go find you

736
00:46:01.467 --> 00:46:04.095
I asked you why there is only one left on the table.

737
00:46:05.596 --> 00:46:06.722
You don't remember?

738
00:46:09.517 --> 00:46:10.768
What did I say?

739
00:46:10.851 --> 00:46:11.852
You say you don't know

740
00:46:12.478 --> 00:46:15.189
I'll go to your room and dig through the trash can

741
00:46:15.273 --> 00:46:16.399
Turn out the banana peel

742
00:46:16.482 --> 00:46:18.651
I'll show it to you and yell at you

743
00:46:18.734 --> 00:46:20.361
Asking why you ate mine

744
00:46:22.905 --> 00:46:24.532
Do you know what you did then?

745
00:46:27.493 --> 00:46:29.787
you slapped me

746
00:46:32.790 --> 00:46:34.625
I cried to find my mother

747
00:46:36.335 --> 00:46:37.211
But she said

748
00:46:37.295 --> 00:46:40.923
“What’s wrong with your brother eating one more?
What’s the big deal?”

749
00:46:41.007 --> 00:46:45.511
I said you hit me and she just ignored me.

750
00:46:47.138 --> 00:46:48.139
Hey

751
00:46:50.975 --> 00:46:53.102
This is how I exist at home

752
00:47:06.907 --> 00:47:09.201
When I was in third grade, it was my first time

753
00:47:09.869 --> 00:47:12.079
Become the deputy squad leader and go home happily

754
00:47:12.163 --> 00:47:13.456
Do you remember what you said?

755
00:47:15.499 --> 00:47:16.500
Don't remember

756
00:47:16.584 --> 00:47:18.127
You don't remember?

757
00:47:18.210 --> 00:47:20.296
Damn it, I told you I don’t remember!

758
00:47:23.174 --> 00:47:24.467
Hey, so you...

759
00:47:25.926 --> 00:47:27.511
Don't remember anything

760
00:47:40.775 --> 00:47:42.777
I am the only one who remembers

761
00:47:48.407 --> 00:47:49.700
I'll sleep first

762
00:48:19.438 --> 00:48:21.899
Didn’t the people who came to see the house yesterday also want to rent?

763
00:48:21.982 --> 00:48:25.319
"Free rent for the first three months" has no effect

764
00:48:25.403 --> 00:48:29.073
Then help me add short-term rentals to the list.

765
00:48:29.156 --> 00:48:30.866
This might be best

766
00:48:31.534 --> 00:48:32.952
Take your time and watch

767
00:48:33.035 --> 00:48:34.286
OK thank you

768
00:48:35.538 --> 00:48:37.581
I almost forgot, ma'am.

769
00:48:37.665 --> 00:48:42.169
Please advise the boss not to sleep here as much as possible

770
00:48:42.253 --> 00:48:43.170
What?

771
00:48:43.254 --> 00:48:45.381
He looks so desperate that way

772
00:48:45.464 --> 00:48:48.551
In the eyes of potential tenants
This is a big minus

773
00:48:50.344 --> 00:48:51.887
Wait, he slept here?

774
00:48:51.971 --> 00:48:54.932
Oh, you don't know

775
00:48:55.015 --> 00:48:59.353
Ah, take your time and take a look

776
00:49:05.734 --> 00:49:06.819
What is that?

777
00:49:07.820 --> 00:49:08.696
Oops

778
00:49:20.749 --> 00:49:22.042
(Super urgent sale)

779
00:49:22.209 --> 00:49:23.544
(Super urgent sale, original price 500 million, current price 380 million)

780
00:49:23.627 --> 00:49:24.670
(for rent)

781
00:49:32.970 --> 00:49:34.263
(Recruitment: 3 million won per month)

782
00:49:36.348 --> 00:49:40.394
Nak Soo, Kim Nak Soo

783
00:49:41.979 --> 00:49:42.938
Oops

784
00:49:44.148 --> 00:49:45.149
come in

785
00:49:46.358 --> 00:49:48.944
The house has been bought, what else are you nagging about?

786
00:49:49.028 --> 00:49:51.780
Sit down and listen to me, Suqian, you sit down too

787
00:49:51.864 --> 00:49:53.908
- Ouch
- Sit quickly

788
00:49:53.991 --> 00:49:56.285
Come and listen

789
00:49:56.785 --> 00:49:58.871
From the entrance to the toilet

790
00:49:58.954 --> 00:50:01.207
Go to Soo-gyeom's room again

791
00:50:01.290 --> 00:50:04.084
Used me from ordinary staff to agent
A full ten years' salary

792
00:50:04.168 --> 00:50:05.169
Next

793
00:50:05.252 --> 00:50:08.547
The kitchen, the function room, and this bedroom

794
00:50:08.631 --> 00:50:11.217
It cost me five years’ salary as a section chief

795
00:50:11.300 --> 00:50:16.347
Finally, when I grow up these five years

796
00:50:16.430 --> 00:50:19.683
I worked my ass off and used up all my savings.

797
00:50:20.559 --> 00:50:24.021
It took a lot of effort to buy this living room and balcony

798
00:50:24.647 --> 00:50:28.317
You're always complaining that you've had enough of moving.

799
00:50:28.400 --> 00:50:29.818
That's why I bought this house

800
00:50:30.569 --> 00:50:32.738
But don't you two forget

801
00:50:33.531 --> 00:50:34.865
this apartment

802
00:50:35.908 --> 00:50:37.910
What condensed my 51 years

803
00:50:39.620 --> 00:50:40.871
painstaking effort

804
00:50:42.373 --> 00:50:43.624
It's my trophy

805
00:50:46.275 --> 00:50:47.378
Do you understand?

806
00:50:47.461 --> 00:50:48.879
You are the best!

807
00:50:50.673 --> 00:50:51.975
Dad, you are the best!

808
00:50:54.635 --> 00:50:56.095
come on

809
00:50:56.178 --> 00:50:57.429
You've worked hard too, wife

810
00:50:57.513 --> 00:51:00.266
Thank you for your hard work!

811
00:51:01.850 --> 00:51:03.394
This is our home!

812
00:51:03.477 --> 00:51:04.853
let's have a drink

813
00:51:05.854 --> 00:51:06.772
OK

814
00:51:19.034 --> 00:51:20.578
What should we do?

815
00:51:21.453 --> 00:51:24.164
This trophy cannot be used as food.

816
00:52:13.797 --> 00:52:14.923
Hey you're up

817
00:52:15.507 --> 00:52:16.550
I'm leaving

818
00:52:16.634 --> 00:52:17.635
Good

819
00:52:18.510 --> 00:52:19.553
thank you for taking me in

820
00:52:20.179 --> 00:52:21.221
Yeah

821
00:52:22.222 --> 00:52:23.641
- good morning
- good morning

822
00:52:23.724 --> 00:52:25.768
You guys are lazy. Why didn't you come earlier?

823
00:52:25.851 --> 00:52:27.895
What's wrong? We arrived five minutes early

824
00:52:27.978 --> 00:52:29.313
- Hello
- Hello

825
00:52:29.396 --> 00:52:30.898
Ask him, go ahead

826
00:52:30.981 --> 00:52:32.399
No, just ask

827
00:52:33.484 --> 00:52:36.195
Sorry, are you the boss's brother?

828
00:52:39.198 --> 00:52:41.283
- Ah!
- give it to me

829
00:52:41.367 --> 00:52:42.993
They look nothing alike

830
00:52:43.077 --> 00:52:45.412
Look at their faces. It's obvious.

831
00:52:45.496 --> 00:52:47.039
You have so much money that you have nowhere to spend it, right?

832
00:52:47.122 --> 00:52:48.540
Brat, hurry up and change your clothes.

833
00:52:48.624 --> 00:52:49.500
Yes

834
00:52:49.583 --> 00:52:52.378
The boss often mentions you

835
00:52:52.461 --> 00:52:53.337
What did he say?

836
00:52:53.420 --> 00:52:56.340
Say that you are proud to hold a very high position in ACT...

837
00:52:56.423 --> 00:52:57.883
- Hello!
- Okay, let's go

838
00:52:58.759 --> 00:53:00.761
- Come on, buy me a cup of coffee.
- What?

839
00:53:00.844 --> 00:53:01.929
This guy talks too much

840
00:53:02.638 --> 00:53:03.639
Let's go

841
00:53:05.891 --> 00:53:09.186
I put something on my desk in the office

842
00:53:09.812 --> 00:53:10.854
Remember to take it

843
00:53:25.327 --> 00:53:28.539
I ate it. Sorry.

844
00:53:50.853 --> 00:53:54.857
What would happen if my brother apologized at that time?

845
00:53:54.940 --> 00:53:56.525
If I become the deputy squad leader

846
00:53:57.443 --> 00:53:59.945
How about he say "congratulations"?

847
00:54:00.946 --> 00:54:01.947
Will I be different?

848
00:54:03.407 --> 00:54:06.702
- Why is it different?
- Maybe I won't feel it

849
00:54:06.785 --> 00:54:09.997
Everyone in the world is my competitor

850
00:54:10.956 --> 00:54:14.042
There would be no such strong jealousy and sense of superiority

851
00:54:14.126 --> 00:54:15.169
Will this happen?

852
00:54:15.252 --> 00:54:17.588
Oh no one would know this

853
00:54:17.671 --> 00:54:19.673
Unless we can go to a parallel universe

854
00:54:21.550 --> 00:54:23.677
Besides, maybe it’s that competitive spirit

855
00:54:23.761 --> 00:54:25.888
That’s why you’ve been able to hold on all the way until now

856
00:54:25.971 --> 00:54:28.640
Feed the whole family

857
00:54:28.724 --> 00:54:31.977
You're right, that's right

858
00:54:32.770 --> 00:54:35.481
Alternatively, this could also be
In order to prove that your sword is still young

859
00:54:35.981 --> 00:54:38.442
The reason why I made that high-risk investment

860
00:54:41.528 --> 00:54:43.614
Suddenly lost my appetite

861
00:54:46.992 --> 00:54:48.911
How many children do you have?

862
00:54:49.953 --> 00:54:51.079
i have a son

863
00:54:51.163 --> 00:54:53.457
Then you must have thought of yourself as a child

864
00:54:53.540 --> 00:54:55.626
What I didn’t get from my parents

865
00:54:55.709 --> 00:54:58.045
love and encouragement

866
00:54:59.087 --> 00:55:00.631
You're all focused on your son, right?

867
00:55:02.216 --> 00:55:04.384
- Well...
- Will express his love frequently

868
00:55:07.179 --> 00:55:11.099
I dare not say anything else, but in terms of his education

869
00:55:11.183 --> 00:55:14.937
I always give him the best

870
00:55:15.979 --> 00:55:18.690
Send him to the best cram school

871
00:55:18.774 --> 00:55:20.526
I also found him a tutor

872
00:55:20.609 --> 00:55:22.236
I've done everything I can do

873
00:55:24.696 --> 00:55:26.990
Do you know what that sounds like to me?

874
00:55:29.660 --> 00:55:32.996
“I took the bananas I didn’t eat when I was a kid
I bought them all for him.”

875
00:55:34.164 --> 00:55:35.165
That's what it sounds like

876
00:55:35.791 --> 00:55:37.626
But now

877
00:55:37.709 --> 00:55:41.004
These bananas only cost 3,000 won per bunch.

878
00:56:02.776 --> 00:56:03.652
Wife

879
00:56:09.074 --> 00:56:09.950
Wife?

880
00:56:17.457 --> 00:56:18.750
Very good

881
00:56:23.130 --> 00:56:24.298
Let me take a look

882
00:56:25.507 --> 00:56:27.259
What delicious food did you make today?

883
00:56:52.242 --> 00:56:53.577
Do you want me to cook another pack?

884
00:56:55.996 --> 00:56:56.997
No

885
00:56:57.080 --> 00:56:59.666
If your mother got off work early
I got home at almost six o'clock

886
00:57:00.167 --> 00:57:01.752
Want something to eat?

887
00:57:01.835 --> 00:57:03.545
No, you can eat it, Dad

888
00:57:10.719 --> 00:57:12.012
Where have you been living lately?

889
00:57:12.763 --> 00:57:15.933
Internet cafe or my friend’s house

890
00:57:17.643 --> 00:57:18.560
Good

891
00:57:25.525 --> 00:57:26.526
Hello

892
00:57:28.445 --> 00:57:32.032
Did you really not want to repeat your studies in the first place?

893
00:57:39.331 --> 00:57:40.749
That's my own decision

894
00:57:48.799 --> 00:57:50.300
Add some rice?

895
00:57:50.968 --> 00:57:51.969
Don't

896
00:57:52.552 --> 00:57:54.513
- Mom gets home at six o'clock...
- It won't be long

897
00:57:54.596 --> 00:57:55.514
No dad

898
00:57:59.351 --> 00:58:00.894
What's wrong?

899
00:58:04.231 --> 00:58:06.233
What did I tell you?

900
00:58:06.316 --> 00:58:08.151
Fortunately we didn't cook an extra pack of instant noodles

901
00:58:08.235 --> 00:58:11.196
Just listen to dad and good things will happen. Do you hear me?

902
00:58:12.781 --> 00:58:14.950
You still want to add rice? I stopped you.

903
00:58:15.033 --> 00:58:17.160
You boy

904
00:58:27.629 --> 00:58:29.214
Did she go in?

905
00:58:29.297 --> 00:58:30.632
be careful

906
00:58:33.635 --> 00:58:34.636
Did she go up?

907
00:58:37.723 --> 00:58:39.433
she's gone

908
00:58:51.903 --> 00:58:54.156
- Do you want to continue driving?
- Right

909
00:58:55.115 --> 00:58:57.159
- What? Feel embarrassed?
- No

910
00:58:57.242 --> 00:58:59.453
Why should I feel ashamed when you go to work?

911
00:59:02.330 --> 00:59:05.375
I'm just worried that something will happen to you again

912
00:59:06.960 --> 00:59:08.503
No way, boy

913
00:59:09.171 --> 00:59:11.256
Last time something happened because of a crazy customer.

914
00:59:11.882 --> 00:59:14.009
I'll be careful, don't worry

915
00:59:14.092 --> 00:59:15.302
Go in

916
00:59:16.803 --> 00:59:18.430
Actually...

917
00:59:20.932 --> 00:59:22.893
Do you want to work together?

918
00:59:24.936 --> 00:59:25.979
Why do you want to come together?

919
00:59:26.646 --> 00:59:29.733
What is "why"
I have a debt of thirty million to repay.

920
00:59:31.109 --> 00:59:32.194
Oops

921
00:59:42.537 --> 00:59:44.372
Can you go to Pyeongtaek so late?

922
00:59:45.123 --> 00:59:46.625
How are you going to come back?

923
00:59:47.375 --> 00:59:49.086
It's okay sir

924
01:00:15.278 --> 01:00:16.530
your key

925
01:00:16.613 --> 01:00:18.365
- Thank you for your hard work
- thank you

926
01:00:24.913 --> 01:00:25.872
good

927
01:00:26.498 --> 01:00:27.457
back

928
01:00:32.504 --> 01:00:33.797
(Waiting for order)

929
01:00:33.880 --> 01:00:34.798
Got an order!

930
01:00:34.881 --> 01:00:36.332
Where to go?

931
01:00:36.439 --> 01:00:37.384
Going to Suwon

932
01:00:37.467 --> 01:00:38.415
(Contact customer)

933
01:00:38.515 --> 01:00:40.220
Let's go

934
01:01:19.759 --> 01:01:20.927
- to you
- thank you

935
01:01:21.011 --> 01:01:22.095
Wait

936
01:01:22.721 --> 01:01:23.930
your tip

937
01:01:24.014 --> 01:01:25.640
- Thank you sir
- You're welcome

938
01:01:25.724 --> 01:01:27.058
- Thank you for your hard work
- Soo Gyom!

939
01:01:31.813 --> 01:01:34.107
Look! Got the tip

940
01:01:42.782 --> 01:01:44.534
Why is it so delicious?

941
01:01:44.618 --> 01:01:46.286
There are eggs in it

942
01:01:46.369 --> 01:01:48.038
Eat slowly, dad. Be careful of food accumulation.

943
01:01:50.582 --> 01:01:51.666
Aren't you tired?

944
01:01:53.084 --> 01:01:54.127
Not tired, nothing

945
01:01:54.211 --> 01:01:55.921
Dad is exhausted

946
01:01:58.006 --> 01:01:58.924
And it's still cold

947
01:02:00.467 --> 01:02:01.635
Dad, are you cold?

948
01:02:02.135 --> 01:02:03.553
What if...

949
01:02:07.098 --> 01:02:08.308
(Waiting for order)

950
01:02:09.017 --> 01:02:10.143
- We have an order. Let's go.
- Got it

951
01:02:10.227 --> 01:02:11.353
Quick let's go

952
01:02:50.600 --> 01:02:53.478
Ouch my legs ouch

953
01:03:16.918 --> 01:03:18.003
(Profits can be withdrawn)

954
01:03:18.086 --> 01:03:20.213
We made 340,000 won, Dad

955
01:03:20.297 --> 01:03:22.674
Is it because of the long journey?

956
01:03:22.757 --> 01:03:26.052
After deducting 40,000 for gas, there is about 300,000 left.

957
01:03:26.136 --> 01:03:27.971
- Right
- Oops

958
01:03:28.054 --> 01:03:30.140
I take 160,000, you take 140,000

959
01:03:30.223 --> 01:03:31.474
Why?

960
01:03:31.558 --> 01:03:32.892
That hoodie of yours costs 10,000 won

961
01:03:32.976 --> 01:03:34.269
So stingy

962
01:03:34.853 --> 01:03:36.146
cut

963
01:03:36.646 --> 01:03:38.189
How many pieces of this dress have been sold?

964
01:03:40.525 --> 01:03:43.111
- Almost a hundred pieces
- One hundred pieces?

965
01:03:43.194 --> 01:03:44.988
More than I thought

966
01:03:45.071 --> 01:03:46.156
No more

967
01:03:46.239 --> 01:03:48.283
You are better than me, son

968
01:03:48.366 --> 01:03:51.161
My shop has been empty for three months

969
01:03:52.245 --> 01:03:53.997
I can finally give you a pat on the head.

970
01:03:55.415 --> 01:03:57.625
So do you plan to continue doing it?

971
01:03:58.960 --> 01:03:59.919
I have to do it

972
01:04:01.338 --> 01:04:02.213
Right

973
01:04:02.881 --> 01:04:04.966
This is how business is done

974
01:04:05.759 --> 01:04:08.553
Sometimes it goes well, sometimes it doesn't go well

975
01:04:09.304 --> 01:04:13.475
The market trend is very subtle.

976
01:04:13.558 --> 01:04:17.062
So you should listen to what others say more often.

977
01:04:17.145 --> 01:04:20.899
Those restaurant ladies and taxi drivers?

978
01:04:20.982 --> 01:04:23.318
You can read market trends from their words

979
01:04:25.195 --> 01:04:27.739
What you missed is valuable consultation.

980
01:04:31.868 --> 01:04:34.287
Okay, let's take a nap.

981
01:04:37.665 --> 01:04:38.792
Must be exhausted

982
01:04:43.380 --> 01:04:45.340
But dad is not tired

983
01:05:25.130 --> 01:05:27.590
Really, even going home is all based on my own happiness.

984
01:05:29.634 --> 01:05:30.718
OK

985
01:05:52.449 --> 01:05:53.366
Oops

986
01:06:19.642 --> 01:06:20.894
We are Soo-gyeom

987
01:07:22.872 --> 01:07:25.124
(House photos open)

988
01:07:25.291 --> 01:07:27.252
(Zhixiangjia upload photos)

989
01:07:27.627 --> 01:07:28.586
(Publish property)

990
01:07:37.971 --> 01:07:41.182
(Do you want to publish this property?)

991
01:08:01.869 --> 01:08:03.037
(release)

992
01:08:05.790 --> 01:08:08.751
(House listing completed)

993
01:08:31.065 --> 01:08:35.403
"Minister Kim's Dream Life"

994
01:09:05.642 --> 01:09:07.143
{\an8}I told you not to sell the house

995
01:09:07.226 --> 01:09:09.312
{\an8}Would you like to give it a serious try?

996
01:09:09.395 --> 01:09:12.732
{\an8}Do you really think I can survive in that kind of environment?

997
01:09:12.815 --> 01:09:15.318
{\an8}Are you going to see the president?

998
01:09:15.401 --> 01:09:18.946
{\an8}Du Zhenyu betrayed me and took refuge with Special Agent Huang Taishan

999
01:09:19.530 --> 01:09:22.617
{\an8}It’s because I’m fed up with being treated like a transparent talent.

1000
01:09:23.660 --> 01:09:25.203
{\an8}Hey Luo Zhu

1001
01:09:25.828 --> 01:09:27.622
{\an8}Please help me one last time

1002
01:09:27.705 --> 01:09:29.582
{\an8}It must be something you have to do.

1003
01:09:29.666 --> 01:09:31.542
{\an8}Only you can do it

1004
01:09:32.335 --> 01:09:34.376
{\an8}Kim Nak-soo Executive Director

1005
01:09:35.713 --> 01:09:37.715
{\an8}Subtitle translation: Cheng Jiayue

